 84.6\nMargin of safety below $47\n\nIF YOU HOLD IT\nHold. The price alread
 y reflects a poor outcome\, and selling at 11 times earnings during a chan
 nel correction has historically been the wrong moment in this industry.\n\
 nSIGNALS TO ADD\n• Q3 confirms channel inventory is normal\n• 2027 poo
 l sales guided at or above $1.45bn\n• Insiders buying shares\n• The ne
 w CFO resets guidance conservatively and then meets it\n\nSIGNALS TO SELL\
 n• A third pool guidance cut\n• Pool margin guided below 30% for 2027\
 n• Further admitted share loss\n• Net debt staying above 2.5 times EBI
 TDA into 2028\n• A dividend freeze after 50 years of increases\n\nAFTERW
